luentXR is an ever-evolving platform, continually expanding its selection of languages, locations, and mini-games. Achieve language mastery with FluentXR\u2014where your home becomes your classroom.\n\nNext Expansion: \nSpace: Kitchen\nSpace: Bedroom\nMain Language: French\nLearning Language: Spanish / espa\u00f1ol \nLearning Language: English\nMini-Game: Sentence Scramble", "short_description": "Transform your language learning experience. \n\nUtilizing mixed-reality passthrough technology turn your home into a dynamic classroom. Tag real-world objects in your living room with 470+ customizable tags for learning French. Sharpen your skills through the Word Shuffle mini-game.\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, updating with new languages, locations, and interactive mini-games. Dive into a context-rich home environment that's both captivating and practical."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Fluent XR Mobile Icon.png", "id": "2236631716529956", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2236631719863289_7778467312643440417_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0LqGWOp-2xIQ7kNvwFiojMs&_nc_oc=AdrzPJ03vmdQC4HoE_RRk5EKCWshrJsX_ObJB-bGw06nLJaKJ2-WQQ2OWqGMYD4FHyM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af18vZgx0SrWkc9Nc1Y9xKkUAk6yBIBm6Hk-C8zXXXXxEg&oe=69F20D55"}, {"file_name": "Fluent XR PDP Art.png", "id": "2055286771488876", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974466_2055286774822209_4338361723960595313_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B5CHRm2--oIQ7kNvwHVD2lf&_nc_oc=AdpiHyZ7W3uzDESL77H5uUFtf8x59pNJpFK7w_oxe20pGkL2UKSGJ4gLGdpO7Xly3e4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af21RXEox8ywmtn8g_w-G7j9EdgEz1eAFqkmqkK1UYn_4w&oe=69F1F227"}, {"file_name": "Fluent XR Cover Art.png", "id": "678364797690874", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t